{
  "_meta": {
    "id": "upscale_v1",
    "version": 1,
    "title": "SDXL 高清修复（潜空间放大 + 细节重绘 + 分块解码）",
    "engine": "ComfyUI v0.36.0 (commit ee71d5c4)",
    "models": ["sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors"],
    "license_note": "CreativeML OpenRAIL++-M，可商用；见 docs/sop/license_matrix.md",
    "node_titles": {
      "1": "加载·SDXL 底模（含 VAE）",
      "10": "输入·待放大的图",
      "11": "输入·正向提示词",
      "12": "输入·负向提示词",
      "20": "输入·编码为潜空间",
      "21": "采样·潜空间放大（不引入新信息）",
      "22": "采样·低强度重绘补细节",
      "30": "处理·分块解码（防大图爆显存）",
      "40": "输出·保存图片"
    },
    "note": "免放大器模型路线：LatentUpscaleBy 在潜空间做插值放大（不引入新信息），再由低 denoise 的 KSampler 重绘补细节 —— 这是高清修复的经典做法之一，零新增权重。VAEDecodeTiled 分块解码，避免大图一次性解码爆显存。",
    "todo": "v2 计划：待放大器权重（upscale_models/*）到位后，增加「两段式」分支（UpscaleModelLoader → ImageUpscaleWithModel → VAEEncode → KSampler），用 _meta.switches 声明 bypass —— **不要为每种组合各存一份 JSON**（workflow_spec.md §6.1 明文禁止）"
  },
  "1": {
    "class_type": "CheckpointLoaderSimple",
    "inputs": {
      "ckpt_name": "sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "inputs": {
      "image": "example.png"
    }
  },
  "11": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "text": "professional product photo, on a light grey seamless background, soft studio lighting, subtle shadow, sharp focus, high detail",
      "clip": ["1", 1]
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "text": "blurry, low quality, distorted, deformed, watermark, text, logo, oversaturated, plastic look",
      "clip": ["1", 1]
    }
  },
  "20": {
    "class_type": "VAEEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "pixels": ["10", 0],
      "vae": ["1", 2]
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "class_type": "LatentUpscaleBy",
    "inputs": {
      "samples": ["20", 0],
      "upscale_method": "bislerp",
      "scale_by": 1.5
    }
  },
  "22": {
    "class_type": "KSampler",
    "inputs": {
      "seed": 20260915,
      "steps": 20,
      "cfg": 6.5,
      "sampler_name": "dpmpp_2m",
      "scheduler": "karras",
      "denoise": 0.4,
      "model": ["1", 0],
      "positive": ["11", 0],
      "negative": ["12", 0],
      "latent_image": ["21", 0]
    }
  },
  "30": {
    "class_type": "VAEDecodeTiled",
    "inputs": {
      "samples": ["22", 0],
      "vae": ["1", 2],
      "tile_size": 512,
      "overlap": 64,
      "temporal_size": 64,
      "temporal_overlap": 8
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "class_type": "SaveImage",
    "inputs": {
      "filename_prefix": "upscale_v1/base",
      "images": ["30", 0]
    }
  }
}
